#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/client-libraries/Working-with-Client-Libraries/Single-Package-Define-And-Use-Interface.rst:20
msgid ""
"Defining custom interfaces in the same package as your nodes can simplify "
"small ROS projects and examples. This article shows how to create an "
"AddressBook.msg interface, generate code for it, and use it from a C++ "
"publisher in the same package. After following these steps, you can build, "
"run, and inspect a node that publishes your custom message."
